# RHI Implementation Sequencing

This hierarchy turns the architecture plan into executable phases and tasks.

## Phase index

- Phase 0: Foundations -> [phase-0-foundations.todo](phase-0-foundations.todo)
  Docs: [Architecture Overview](../planning/architecture-overview.md), [Decision Log](../planning/decision-log.md), [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md), [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md), [Resource System](../planning/subsystems/resource-system.md), [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)

- Phase 1: Minimal RHI vertical slice -> [phase-1-minimal-vertical-slice.todo](phase-1-minimal-vertical-slice.todo)
  Docs: [Roadmap](../planning/roadmap.md), [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md), [Command Model](../planning/subsystems/command-model.md), [Shader System](../planning/subsystems/shader-system.md), [Pipeline State](../planning/subsystems/pipeline-state.md), [Descriptors and Binding](../planning/subsystems/descriptors-and-binding.md)

- Phase 2: Textured mesh and basic pipeline state -> [phase-2-textured-mesh.todo](phase-2-textured-mesh.todo)
  Docs: [Shader System](../planning/subsystems/shader-system.md), [Descriptors and Binding](../planning/subsystems/descriptors-and-binding.md), [Pipeline State](../planning/subsystems/pipeline-state.md)

- Phase 3: Render targets, depth, and presentation -> [phase-3-render-targets.todo](phase-3-render-targets.todo)
  Docs: [Presentation](../planning/subsystems/presentation.md), [Synchronization](../planning/subsystems/synchronization.md), [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md)

- Phase 4: Synchronization and explicit resource states -> [phase-4-sync-and-barriers.todo](phase-4-sync-and-barriers.todo)
  Docs: [Resource State Model](../planning/subsystems/resource-state-model.md), [Synchronization](../planning/subsystems/synchronization.md), [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)

- Phase 5: Full feature set and scale -> [phase-5-full-feature.todo](phase-5-full-feature.todo)
  Docs: [Shader System](../planning/subsystems/shader-system.md), [Pipeline State](../planning/subsystems/pipeline-state.md), [Driver Backends](../planning/subsystems/driver-backends.md), [Diagnostics and Tooling](../planning/subsystems/diagnostics-and-tooling.md)

## Notes

- Each phase file contains sub-phases with fine-grained tasks.
- Align milestones with [Roadmap](../planning/roadmap.md).
